  "description": "\"Everyone in the world looks like a cat?!\"\n\nSomi has returned to the past with a unique ability: she sees every human being as a feline. Determined to live her life again—this time free from the prejudices of physical appearance, she encounters two very special cats... or rather, two men.\n\nHow far can a love triangle between a human and \"cats\" actually go? \n\nIt’s a love triangle featuring a woman who finds everyone adorable now that her superficial biases are gone, and the two cats vying for her heart.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=850657), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14152275)",
